    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR replaces the previous Python-based YAML resolver with a pure Ruby implementation in the `udb` gem, aiming to preserve YAML comments/formatting while supporting `$inherits`, `$remove`, and optional embedded IDL compilation.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Remove the Python resolver and its direct dependency on `ruamel.yaml`.\n- Add Ruby YAML parsing/emitting/resolution components (`CommentParser`, `PreservingEmitter`, `Resolver`) plus documentation.\n- Add/adjust tests around resolution, comment/string-style preservation, source maps, and IDL compilation; extend `idlc` source tracking to support byte offsets.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 10 out of 14 changed files in this pull request and generated 7 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `uv.lock` | Drops top-level dependency entries for `ruamel-yaml`. |\r\n| `pyproject.toml` | Removes `ruamel.yaml` from Python deps. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/python/yaml_resolver.py` | Deletes the Python resolver implementation. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/yaml/yaml_resolver.rb` | New Ruby resolver: merge/resolve, `$inherits`/`$remove`, optional IDL compilation, source-location tracking. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/yaml/comment_parser.rb` | New comment extraction + key-path association + string-style tracking. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/yaml/preserving_emitter.rb` | New YAML emitter preserving comments/styles and emitting a source-map section. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/yaml/README.md` | Documentation for the Ruby YAML resolver. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/resolver.rb` | Switches merge/resolve steps to the Ruby YAML resolver. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_yaml_loader.rb` | Updates tests to invoke Ruby resolver instead of spawning the Python script. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_yaml_resolver.rb` | Adds comprehensive tests for the new Ruby resolver components. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/idlc/lib/idlc/ast.rb` | Adds `starting_offset` and incorporates it into `source_yaml`; adds unary-op validation. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb/sorbet/rbi/gems/idlc@0.1.0.rbi` | Updates RBI for new `set_input_file` / `set_input_file_unless_already_set` signature. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/idlc@0.1.0.rbi` | Same RBI updates for generated gem. |\r\n| `tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/udb@0.1.0.rbi` | Adds RBIs for the new `Udb::Yaml::*` classes. |\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Files not reviewed (3)</summary>\n\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/idlc@0.1.0.rbi**: Language not supported\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/udb@0.1.0.rbi**: Language not supported\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb/sorbet/rbi/gems/idlc@0.1.0.rbi**: Language not supported\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
